# QuickCart Frontend Environment Variables
# In local development, leave blank to use the Vite proxy to localhost:5001.
# In production on Vercel, set this to your AWS ALB DNS or backend API endpoint:
# e.g., VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://quickcart-alb-123456789.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
